{
    "0": {
        "0_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<ts$Ariya  $Reimu  $Kanako  >The bottom of the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain."
            ]
        },
        "1_0": {
            "lines": [
                "After a painful battle, Reimu Hakurei",
                "defeated Ariya Iwanaga, the goddess of unchanging."
            ]
        },
        "2_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >I'm glad I placed my bets on you after all."
            ]
        },
        "3_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Now I can take some time off work without feeling guilty. I couldn't care less about the Lunar Capital anymore."
            ]
        },
        "4_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Hey-wait, is Gensokyo going back to normal?"
            ]
        },
        "5_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >If I release my power, Gensokyo will return to its usual state."
            ]
        },
        "6_0": {
            "lines": [
                "However..."
            ]
        },
        "7_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >...a massive flood of impurity from the Outside World will flow in."
            ]
        },
        "8_0": {
            "lines": [
                "How that affects things—that depends on you."
            ]
        },
        "9_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >\"Depends on me\"? What’s that supposed to mean...?"
            ]
        },
        "10_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Ariya  >Why don't you witness Gensokyo's changes with your own eyes?"
            ]
        },
        "11_0": {
            "lines": [
                "The Hakurei Shrine."
            ]
        },
        "12_0": {
            "lines": [
                "A shrine on the outskirts of Gensokyo."
            ]
        },
        "41_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Congratulations!$>",
                "<c$Congratulations on your No Continue Clear!$>"
            ]
        },
        "40_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<c$Ending No.08 — An Old Friend$>"
            ]
        },
        "13_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Kanako  >The person in the Pyramid..."
            ]
        },
        "15_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Do you know her?"
            ]
        },
        "16_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Kanako  >If that person is the princess of the Yuiman Kingdom..."
            ]
        },
        "17_0": {
            "lines": [
                "No, but... It can't be!"
            ]
        },
        "18_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >She seemed confused. She wasn't even sure if that was her name."
            ]
        },
        "19_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Kanako  >When I found out that the name of the pyramid was the Asama Impurity-Cleansing Mountain, I started thinking."
            ]
        },
        "20_0": {
            "lines": [
                "That Yuiman probably was the Yuiman Kingdom's princess."
            ]
        },
        "21_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >What kind of person is she?"
            ]
        },
        "22_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Kanako  >She's a god from my hometown."
            ]
        },
        "23_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She was innocent, intelligent, and loved hunting deer."
            ]
        },
        "24_0": {
            "lines": [
                "To think she was be being held in a Lunar Capital facility..."
            ]
        },
        "25_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Aah, so she was captured."
            ]
        },
        "26_0": {
            "lines": [
                "She was a real weirdo though, couldn't even hold a conversation."
            ]
        },
        "28_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Ah, I see."
            ]
        },
        "29_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Kanako  >What do you say, Reimu?"
            ]
        },
        "30_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >Huh?"
            ]
        },
        "31_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Kanako  >Should we confront the Lunarians and rescue my old friend?"
            ]
        },
        "32_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Or will you ignore everything for the sake of Gensokyo?"
            ]
        },
        "33_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Reimu  >That's......"
            ]
        },
        "34_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Kanako seems to have assumed that Yuiman is the victim."
            ]
        },
        "35_0": {
            "lines": [
                "But from Reimu's perspective, she didn't seem unhappy at all."
            ]
        },
        "36_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Maybe to gods, the Lunar Capital seems many times more",
                "divine and dignified than Gensokyo"
            ]
        },
        "37_0": {
            "lines": [
                "To start with, Yuiman's story didn't make sense."
            ]
        },
        "38_0": {
            "lines": [
                "Kanako thought that so much information was coming in from ",
                "the outside world that it was eroding her brain."
            ]
        },
        "39_0": {
            "lines": [
                "If so, then maybe rescuing her would be the best choice.",
                "So Reimu thought."
            ]
        },
        "14_0": {
            "lines": [
                "...she called herself Yuiman?!"
            ]
        },
        "27_0": {
            "lines": [
                "<r$Kanako  >Then it really is her. She was a weird one back then as well."
            ]
        }
    }
}